      ":question/problem": "A dataset of $19$ different exam scores has a mean of $70$ and a median of $70$. A new dataset is created by adding $3$ to each score. Which of the following measures has the same value in both the original and new datasets?\n\n1. Mean\n2. Median\n3. Range\n4. Standard deviation"
